units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 4.05
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Al
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 every 1
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all npt temp 300 300 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
run 500000
